.violation D412_blank_lines_between_header_and_content_numpy_capitalized(at: node, n: node) code "D412" "Remove the blank lines between the `{n}` header and its content; keep one blank line only when the content is a reStructuredText directive (`.. `)."
    suppress noqa "D412"
// N: not bound by this rule, so empty (unset) here, as in ast-grep.
D412_blank_lines_between_header_and_content_numpy_capitalized(rr_at, N) :- kind(n, "string_content"), child(p1_6, n, _), d412_docstring(p1_6), (d412_spaced_header_numpy(n, w6_k, w6_l, N) ; d412_spaced_first_numpy(n, w6_f)), d412_numpy_mode(n), !d412_directive_hides_header(n),
    unset(N),
    (unset(N), rr_at = n ; !unset(N), rr_at = N).
// N: not bound by this rule, so empty (unset) here, as in ast-grep.
D412_blank_lines_between_header_and_content_numpy_capitalized(rr_at, N) :- kind(n, "string_content"), child(p1_2, n, _), d412_docstring(p1_2), (d412_spaced_header_google(n, w2_k, w2_l, N) ; d412_spaced_first_google(n, w2_f)), !d412_numpy_mode(n), !d412_directive_hides_header(n),
    unset(N),
    (unset(N), rr_at = n ; !unset(N), rr_at = N).

// D412_blank_lines_between_header_and_content_numpy_underlined(n): findings from clauses `blank-lines-between-header-and-content-numpy-underlined`, `blank-lines-between-header-and-content-google-underlined`, which say the same.
